cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 2,105 new best-known packings of equal circles in a triangle, a quadrant and rectangles"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-24
version: "1.3"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  2,105 packings of equal circles that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables for the isosceles right triangle
  (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq) and eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), each with an exact certificate verified by
  two independently written exact-rational checkers. Results already surpassed in the literature (Lai et al. 2025;
  López & Beasley 2011) are excluded.
